ems a=20
sort of frill, as do the segments: the one a fancy way to talk about all of=
 them=20
at once, the other a fancy way to do tensed sentences.  I don't see brodas =
as=20
derivative from brodakind and I don't see John as the sum of all his parts,=
 in=20
any sense.




